      "start_time": 342.21,
      "end_time": 344.842
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, I can see, I can hear.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 344.866,
      "end_time": 346.282
    },
    {
      "text": "And now I can see you, thanks to modern technology.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 346.306,
      "end_time": 349.67
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me just.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 351.49,
      "end_time": 352.63
    },
    {
      "text": "You know what, since I been texting you, I've just had a.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 353.25,
      "end_time": 357.83
    },
    {
      "text": "You had a cagey conversation.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 361.97,
      "end_time": 363.85
    },
    {
      "text": "No, a career changing.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 363.93,
      "end_time": 365.45
    },
    {
      "text": "I just got off the phone.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 365.53,
      "end_time": 366.794
    },
    {
      "text": "I've been trying to find my way into car dealership because there's no way I'm going to try and speak to 4,500 car dealerships around the UK and say, I need to improve your service level with customer communications via AI, But I don't have the energy, the time or the resource or the, the, the, the bandwidth to certainly go out to 4,500 dealership groups.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 366.842,
      "end_time": 389.898
    },
    {
      "text": "And then I met this guy at Adweek last week.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 389.914,
      "end_time": 392.09
    },
    {
      "text": "We've been having a conversation.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 392.13,
      "end_time": 393.194
    },
    {
      "text": "He went, oh, no, I made Q1, I've made 1.4 million outbound call.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 393.242,
      "end_time": 399.03
    },
    {
      "text": "I went, what?",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 399.33,
      "end_time": 400.57
    },
    {
      "text": "Anyway, I outsourced it all.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 400.69,
      "end_time": 402.55
    },
    {
      "text": "Hold on a minute.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 403.33,
      "end_time": 404.65
    },
    {
      "text": "Do better here.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 404.81,
      "end_time": 405.99
    },
    {
      "text": "Outsource it to.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 406.61,
      "end_time": 407.91
    },
    {
      "text": "One of these main suppliers was a company called Direct Affiliative.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 408.85,
      "end_time": 412.554
    },
    {
      "text": "They based that in.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 412.602,
      "end_time": 414.07
    },
    {
      "text": "They do the majority of these work.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 416.78,
      "end_time": 418.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 419.58,
      "end_time": 420.004
    },
    {
      "text": "I was just like, oh.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 420.052,
      "end_time": 421.268
    },
    {
      "text": "And he went, we've been looking for AI, but we've never seen AI quite as advanced as yours.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 421.364,
      "end_time": 426.532
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's do some business.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 426.596,
      "end_time": 427.556
    },
    {
      "text": "I was like, okay, so, yeah, so that was.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 427.628,
      "end_time": 430.436
    },
    {
      "text": "That came out of nowhere as well.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 430.588,
      "end_time": 432.32
    },
    {
      "text": "I've been a busy morning.",
      "speaker_name": "neilshaylor",
      "start_time": 433.34,
      "end_time": 434.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, brilliant.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 435.26,
      "end_time": 436.34
    },
    {
      "text": "Congratulations.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 436.5,
      "end_time": 437.54
    },
    {
      "text": "Just remember who your mates are.",
      "speaker_name": "Andy Day",
      "start_time": 437.62,
      "end_time": 440.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Hey, look, it's not my business.",
